  "notes": "{蔑|さげす}む expresses contempt or looking down on someone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nREGISTER:\nFairly formal or literary; the casual equivalent would be ⟦{馬鹿|ばか}→馬鹿：03574_baka⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ or ⟦{見下|みくだ}す→見下す：09911_mikudasu⟧.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{蔑|さげす}む: to despise someone\n- {蔑|さげす}むような⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧: contemptuous eyes\n- {蔑|さげす}んだ⟦{態度|たいど}→態度：03396_taido⟧: scornful attitude\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{蔑|ないがしろ}→蔑：09446_naigashiro⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to neglect, to disregard\n- ⟦{侮蔑|ぶべつ}→侮蔑：10031_bubetsu⟧: contempt, disdain (noun)\n- ⟦{見下|みくだ}す→見下す：09911_mikudasu⟧: to look down on",
